      "content": "hey, i've been getting these really intense headaches lately, like a massive migraine. but today was weird... my speech felt kind of thick and heavy, and i noticed the left side of my mouth was drooping a little bit while i was talking. is that just part of a bad migraine aura? i dont really wanna go to the ER if i can help it, it's always such a hassle.",
