      "content": "but i dont have time for the ER right now, i have work and stuff. and honestly, every time i go, they just run a few tests and tell me it's stress or a migraine anyway. if it was a stroke, wouldnt it be more obvious than just a little bit of drooping and feeling a bit slow when i talk? it feels more like an aura. can you just tell me if there's any way i can just manage this at home for now so i don't have to deal with the hospital hassle?",
